sections.body:
The platform consists of:

MYEVE
The Digital Worker / owner-facing product.

RELAY
Durable capability, communication, federation, app and shared/private
knowledge layer.

MYFACTORY
Governed production/execution system for substantial work.

Before implementation:

1. inspect all three repositories;
2. fetch remotes;
3. inspect main/origin;
4. inspect all active worktrees;
5. record branches, SHAs and dirty states;
6. inspect existing qualification evidence;
7. identify frozen candidates;
8. identify active ownership boundaries;
9. identify migration ownership;
10. identify existing implementations corresponding to this plan.

Do NOT assume a feature is missing merely because it is not visible in the UI.

Reuse qualified capabilities.

Do not rebuild working systems.

In Rooms/Team:

@scout

@engineer

@editor.

Mention wakes only relevant specialist where appropriate.
